# Fixed defect 2463, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg, the catalogue's half: an entry
# named `main` beside the entry `json` the file reaches. The catalogue's
# reader asks the one rule of an entry's name, which refuses `main`, at its
# line, and a catalogue that does not read names no entry (panel 235's R5).
use <json>/p  #~ catalogue_refused

function main()
    print(p.word())
